* Short variable declarations

Inside a function, the ⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000001⟫:=⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000002⟫ short assignment statement can be used in place of a ⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000003⟫var⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000004⟫ declaration with implicit type.

Outside a function, every statement begins with a keyword (⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000005⟫var⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000006⟫, ⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000007⟫func⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000008⟫, and so on) and so the ⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000009⟫:=⟪GTI18N_f402e8e8_000010⟫ construct is not available.

